ll waiting room with no Dentrix is the last thing you need. Here's the short version:\n\nAll three offices lost access around 8:47 AM because of a network security certificate on our equipment that expired overnight. It didn't take down your server or your data — it just blocked the connection between locations, which is why Midtown and Riverside were affected and the main office wasn't. No patient records were touched, lost, or exposed at any point.\n\nWe had all three offices back up by 10:25 AM.\n\nGoing forward, we're putting monitoring in place that will alert us 30 days before any certificate like this expires, so we catch it long before it becomes a problem. That will be live by Friday.\n\nThanks for your patience this morning, and please let the front desk teams know it's resolved.\n\nTim\nNorthline IT","ttft_ms":4753,"type":"result","duration_ms":4787,"uuid":"61e19e74-b330-4690-81ed-ff471d39eb0d","ttft_stream_ms":738,"time_to_request_ms":56,"first_content_frame_ms":738,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
